# Copy this file to  tor/bridges.conf  and paste your own bridge lines below.
#
# Get bridges (pick obfs4) from any of:
#   - https://bridges.torproject.org/  (choose "obfs4")
#   - Email bridges@torproject.org from Gmail/Riseup with body: get transport obfs4
#   - Telegram: @GetBridgesBot
#
# Each line looks like this (these are EXAMPLES — they will not work, get real ones):
#
# Bridge obfs4 192.0.2.10:443 0123456789ABCDEF0123456789ABCDEF01234567 cert=aBcDeF...xyz iat-mode=0
# Bridge obfs4 198.51.100.7:9001 89ABCDEF0123456789ABCDEF0123456789ABCDEF cert=gHiJkL...uvw iat-mode=0
#
# 2-3 bridges is plenty. Keep the real file private (it's gitignored).
